    Add size-based log rotation documentation (#8062)
    
    Related to #5190.
    
    #5190 asks for a size based log rotate. ~This switches the appender to
    RollingRandomAccessFile with a 50MB SizeBasedTriggeringPolicy, matching
    the style Karaf's own bundled config uses for karaf.log.~
    
    ~More importantly this PR asks the question on whether we want to have
    certain log rotation settings by default, and where we want those to
    live. Apparently the rpm builds add a time based log rotation, but that
    of course only affects rpm builds.~
    
    This adds a suggestion for size based log rotation to the docs.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Set `log4j2.appender.out.policies.size.size` to something smaller, e.g
    10KB, and start Opencast.
    
    ### AI Usage
    
    Claude Sonnet 5 was used with this PR.
    
